update content set data=jsonb_set(data,'{sets,3,questions,1,explain}',to_jsonb($mk$정답 (B) Mr. Radames
정답 포인트 — 지문 "in honor of Antonio Radames, founder of the association" → 보기 "Mr. Radames" (founder of the association → started the LPBA)
