update content set data=jsonb_set(data,'{sets,0,questions,1,explain}',to_jsonb($mk$정답 (D) It aims to build local partnerships.
정답 포인트 — 지문 "LCPA has connections with many employers" / "Recently, LCPA established a relationship with Pathways Careers" / "If you are a local employer interested in participating in LCPA, please contact Justin Grisham, Outreach Coordinator" → 보기 "It aims to build local partnerships." (connections / established a relationship / local employer → local partnerships)
