update content set data=jsonb_set(data,'{sets,1,questions,2,explain}',to_jsonb($mk$정답 (D) Food and beverages will be provided.
정답 포인트 — 지문 "Refreshments will be served." → 보기 "Food and beverages will be provided." (Refreshments → food and beverages / served → provided)
