update content set data=jsonb_set(data,'{sets,3,questions,1,explain}',to_jsonb($mk$정답 (D) He is looking at the details of Ms. Orbes' account.
정답 포인트 — 지문 "Can you check my account?" → "I'm bringing it up now. It states here that the credit card you have on file with us has expired" → 보기 "He is looking at the details of Ms. Orbes' account." (it = my account, bring up → 화면에 띄워 보다)
