update content set data=jsonb_set(data,'{sets,0,questions,0,explain}',to_jsonb($mk$정답 (B) To recognize an anniversary
정답 포인트 — 지문 "This February marks 10 years since our founding. To commemorate our first decade in business, we are offering 25 percent off" → 보기 "To recognize an anniversary" (창립 10년을 기념 → 기념일을 축하)
